This software was created as part of the development process as a proving ground for the PUTSI firmware. It runs the PUTSI code on a PC and simulates the 
encoder operation, using the same code as the microcontroller. Setting values for the A/D's and inputs is accomplished with window dialog boxes. It can 
connect directly to Allstar using a serial port back-to-back cable. 

We hope that it will be useful in debugging Allstar applications, and to exercise the functions of the telemetry module. 

It is an unsupported product, however those modules common to the production code will be kept in sync as time goes on.

